  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 11.64,
   "text": "Second good check, checked, the same way that's point two spent, the limit reached, one more call, and the contract says no before any money moves."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.64,
   "end": 18.62,
   "text": "Overbudget, refused, on the record, this protects the buyer, not the seller."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.22,
   "end": 27.6,
   "text": "A dishonest buyer could, still claim a failure, the buyer checks every receipt, the contract only pays on one the buyer has signed."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.6,
   "end": 32.28,
   "text": "Meeted pay, failed call, deducted zero."
  }
